{"id": "71825", "title": "我成为魔界王后的日子", "author": "花宵", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 10, "available": 10, "cover": "files/article/image/71/71825/71825s.jpg", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/71/71825.htm", "intro": "属性分类：架空／其他／一般言情／幻想\n    关键字：主角 　配角 　其他\n    文案：\n    在这个魔界地狱里，我是魔界之王菲尔的皇后。\n    菲尔身长三公尺，又高又壮，皮肤硬得像铁块，长得一对长獠牙还有长角，\n    说话声音沙哑又霸道，杀人如麻。\n    这是一个我与魔界众异形以及我的丈夫的生活日记，我过得很好，\n    只是周边有点血腥，连床事都很粗暴，如此而已。", "base": "files/article/html/71/71825", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-10", "file": "11291505.html", "available": true}, {"title": "11-23", "file": "11291506.html", "available": true}, {"title": "24-35", "file": "11291507.html", "available": true}, {"title": "36-48", "file": "11291508.html", "available": true}, {"title": "49-60", "file": "11291509.html", "available": true}, {"title": "61-72", "file": "11291510.html", "available": true}, {"title": "73-84", "file": "11291511.html", "available": true}, {"title": "85-97", "file": "11291512.html", "available": true}, {"title": "98-109", "file": "11291513.html", "available": true}, {"title": "110-120", "file": "11291514.html", "available": true}]}